OL,3,GNEWSAMillions of bedbugs crawl out of
OL,4,Amattresses and walls in huge outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of bedbugs were crawling out
OL,7,Fof mattresses in what a pest controller
OL,8,Fsaid was the worst outbreak he had seen
OL,9,Fin 38 years.
OL,11,FThey were even in the walls and under
OL,12,Fthe wallpaper, with the mattresses and
OL,13,Fbed frames needing to be incinerated.
OL,15,FCardiff pest controller Gareth Davies
OL,16,Fhad to wear full protection as his team
OL,17,Ftackled the problem in the Canton area
OL,18,Fof the city, using a specialist vacuum
OL,19,Fcleaner to collect millions of the
OL,20,Fbugs.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
